	"data": "Steam Frame Software Tracker\n\nTracking updates to SteamVR, SteamOS/Holo Core, Lepton/FEX, and the broader Steam Frame software stack.\nCalcifer checks for updates during heartbeat sweeps and logs them here.\nThree tracks watched together: SteamVR, SteamOS/Holo Core, Lepton/FEX.\n\nWhat These Are\n\nValve's three-layer compatibility stack for the Steam Frame (Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, 16GB LPDDR5X, Arch-based SteamOS):\nProton — Windows→Linux (Wine fork, shipped 2018, proven on Steam Deck)\nFEX —…",
